    "prompt": "Compute $(2013^2+1)(2013^4-2013^2+1)-(2013-1)(2013+1)(2013^2+2013+1)(2013^2-2013+1)$.",
    "image": null,
    "choices": null,
    "answer": "2",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Factor cleverly",
        "body": "Let $a=2013$. First factor: $(a^2+1)(a^4-a^2+1)=a^6+1$ (multiply out or use the identity). Second factor: $(a^2-1)(a^2+a+1)(a^2-a+1)=(a^2-1)(a^4+a^2+1)=a^6-1$. So the expression is $(a^6+1)-(a^6-1)=2$."
      }
