    "prompt": "Suppose that the roots of $x^3 - 4x^2 + 7x - 6 = 0$ are $p$, $q$, and $r$. Compute $\\dfrac{1}{p-1} + \\dfrac{1}{q-1} + \\dfrac{1}{r-1}$.",
